            [[- |cff7fd35b/dk trainers on|r  trainer pins on map and minimap (off to hide)]],
            [[- |cffffd100Navigate anywhere|r: open the map (M) on a zone or city and left-click any spot, even empty ground. Ctrl+click works on every map.]],
            [[- A big arrow appears with the place, the distance in yards and which way to turn. Drag it to move it; right-click it to stop. It stops by itself when you arrive.]],
