          short = [[For you]],
          icon = [[INV_Misc_Map_01]],
          lines = {
            [[- |cffffd100The Deadmines|r (16+), Westfall: |cff7fd35bdo this one|r. Entrance: the mine in Moonbrook |cff9d9d9d(about 42, 72)|r.]],
            [[- |cffffd100Ruins of Lordaeron|r (15-20, new), Tirisfal Glades |cff9d9d9d(64.3, 67.2)|r: next to the Horde capital, a very long trip. Only if friends go.]],
            [[- Wailing Caverns (17+) and Shadowfang Keep (18+): deep in Horde land. Skip.]],
            [[- Hall of Thanes: done. Next up at 22+: Blackfathom Deeps (Coming up).]],
